  progressText: {fileID: 276341523}
  loadingTipText: {fileID: 2741386}
  loadingImage: {fileID: 335439450}
  loadingTips:
  - Aim for the head! Headshots deal 5x damage!
  - Chain headshots within 5 seconds for combo bonuses!
  - Save your ammo - headshots are more efficient than body shots.
  - Keep moving - standing still makes you an easy target.
  - Reload behind cover to stay safe from zombies.
  - Upgrade your weapons at the shop to deal more damage.
  - Shotguns are devastating at close range but have spread at distance.
  - Machineguns have high fire rate but consume ammo quickly.
  - Don't let zombies surround you - keep them in front where you can see them.
  - Kill zombies quickly to prevent them from overwhelming you.
  - Each POI has different zombie stats - check the mission details before starting.
